# You Call That a Knife: Vah's Events (131, 132) alternate with his script (UseFallback); 130 (Progress) does not. A level
# 75 Warrior at Windurst fame 425, the quest accepted at Prog 0 and BathedInScent 1 (GMs: his script starts 187, with no
# finish). 131, then his script's 187, then 131 again (UseFallback set). Prog 1 (a GM): 130 (a progress event plays over
# his script's turn), finished: Prog 2. 131, then 187. Nonberry's Knife (a GM): 132, then 187.
lists Kazham/Vah_Keshura/onTrigger
char zone=Kazham pos=27.997,-8.5,-104.267 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Windurst 425
quest Outlands.YouCallThatAKnife accepted
charvar BathedInScent 1
login
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # Prog 0: 131
finish
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # his script's turn: 187
finish
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # 131
finish
charvar Quest[5][6]Prog 1               # a GM
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # Prog 1: 130 (Progress) over his script's turn
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # Prog 2: 131
finish
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # his script's turn: 187
finish
keyitem NonberrysKnife                  # a GM
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # the knife: 132
finish
trigger Vah_Keshura                     # his script's turn: 187
finish
